<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Món gì xong cơ ạ?</font>

198
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:23,130
<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Đi theo anh nào.</font>

199
00:14:23,130 --> 00:14:24,830
<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Dạ? Vâng ạ.</font>

200
00:14:30,420 --> 00:14:31,610
<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Kính chào quý khách.</font>

201
